    "detailed_description": "<strong>An eternal loop begins, where every new beginning is a challenge.</strong><br>Continuously grow stronger to survive in Eternal Rising, a rogue-lite bullet hell where relentless enemies block your path at every turn. Your only option is to keep moving forward, destroying anything that stands in your way. Death is inevitable \u2014 but with each new attempt, you evolve, becoming more powerful and better prepared to face the endless trials of eternal life.<br><br><strong>Battle through six unique worlds in Eternal Rising</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/5ee95f7baeec01fa2aaed264f3689ed5.poster.avif?t=1754390434\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/5ee95f7baeec01fa2aaed264f3689ed5.webm?t=1754390434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Collect experience orbs to unleash powerful attacks and crush your adversaries. Choose from a wide variety of weapons and finely-tuned upgrades to customize your build each run. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/cd8c4e05580fc73dd0e78bee3917172b.poster.avif?t=1754390434\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/cd8c4e05580fc73dd0e78bee3917172b.webm?t=1754390434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/cd8c4e05580fc73dd0e78bee3917172b.mp4?t=1754390434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Eternal Rising, the rules are simple: rise or fall. Use every tool at your disposal to overcome your enemies and carve your path to victory in this unforgiving rogue-lite adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/e996519761edcd9d7dde46385c11bc56.poster.avif?t=1754390434\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/e996519761edcd9d7dde46385c11bc56.webm?t=1754390434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/e996519761edcd9d7dde46385c11bc56.mp4?t=1754390434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Defeat the Guardian Boss to unlock the passage to the next realm. Prepare for epic confrontations and blaze your trail through the unknown, one victory at a time.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>An eternal loop begins, where every new beginning is a challenge.</strong><br>Continuously grow stronger to survive in Eternal Rising, a rogue-lite bullet hell where relentless enemies block your path at every turn. Your only option is to keep moving forward, destroying anything that stands in your way. Death is inevitable \u2014 but with each new attempt, you evolve, becoming more powerful and better prepared to face the endless trials of eternal life.<br><br><strong>Battle through six unique worlds in Eternal Rising</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/5ee95f7baeec01fa2aaed264f3689ed5.poster.avif?t=1754390434\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/5ee95f7baeec01fa2aaed264f3689ed5.webm?t=1754390434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Collect experience orbs to unleash powerful attacks and crush your adversaries. Choose from a wide variety of weapons and finely-tuned upgrades to customize your build each run. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/cd8c4e05580fc73dd0e78bee3917172b.poster.avif?t=1754390434\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/cd8c4e05580fc73dd0e78bee3917172b.webm?t=1754390434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/cd8c4e05580fc73dd0e78bee3917172b.mp4?t=1754390434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Eternal Rising, the rules are simple: rise or fall. Use every tool at your disposal to overcome your enemies and carve your path to victory in this unforgiving rogue-lite adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/e996519761edcd9d7dde46385c11bc56.poster.avif?t=1754390434\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/e996519761edcd9d7dde46385c11bc56.webm?t=1754390434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292870/extras/e996519761edcd9d7dde46385c11bc56.mp4?t=1754390434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Defeat the Guardian Boss to unlock the passage to the next realm. Prepare for epic confrontations and blaze your trail through the unknown, one victory at a time.",
    "short_description": "Trapped in a cycle of death and rebirth, each run pushes you deeper into chaos and power. Eternal Rising is a brutal rogue-lite bullet-hell where survival means constant evolution. Dodge swarms of enemies, unleash powerful abilities and turn failure into unstoppable growth. Die. Adapt. Rise again.",
